flowchart TD
  L[Local rewritten history] --> P{Normal push is fast-forward?}
  P -->|yes| U[Remote can update]
  P -->|no| R[Rejected to protect remote commits]
  R --> F[force-with-lease checks expected remote tip]
  F -->|tip matches| C[Replacement permitted by Git]
  F -->|tip moved| X[Push rejected; inspect new commits]
  C -. still confirm shared-branch policy .-> S[Coordinate before rewriting shared history]
